{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07619","headline":"赠唐祖二子 · 王翰","name":"赠唐祖二子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸿飞遵枉渚，鹿鸣思故羣。\n物情尚劳爱，况乃予别君。\n别时花始发，别後兰再薰。\n瑶觞滋白露，宝瑟凝凉氛。\n裴徊北林月，怅望南山云。\n云月渺千里，音徽不可闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}